:46.684" end="01:50.489">When asked</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.489" end="01:55.993">Who made it show （who made it show）</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.993" end="01:59.684">The truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.684" end="02:03.744">He gives into most</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.744" end="02:10.928">So lay down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.928" end="02:15.119">The threat is real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.119" end="02:19.610">When his sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.610" end="02:27.610">Goes red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.180" end="02:48.743">So lay down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.743" end="02:54.493">The threat is real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.493" end="02:57.619">When his sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.619" end="03:02.993">Goes red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.993" end="03:07.560">So lay down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.560" end="03:12.712">The threat is real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.712" end="03:16.870">When his sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.870" end="03:23.822">Goes red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.822" end="03:28.759">Seeing red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.759" end="03:34.727">Seeing red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.727" end="03:37.541">Seeing red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.541" end="03:39.102">Seeing red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.102" end="03:45.227">Seeing red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.227" end="03:49.665">Seeing red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:49.665" end="03:52.811">Seeing red again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:52.811" end="03:56.811">Seeing red</p></div></body></tt>